<title>Eastern DR Congo: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/drc/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-drc-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;M23 forces have seized positions in Rugezi after a week of fighting with Congolese government troops, while Joseph Kabila now leads a rebel coalition that includes M23. The United States has sanctioned Rwanda's defence ministry and its military bank Zigama and is moving to remove Rwanda and South Africa from the AGOA duty-free trade programme. An Ebola outbreak in eastern DR Congo has killed more than 5,300 people and a UK doctor contracted the disease while responding. IS-linked militants killed at least 33 civilians in a village attack, and the Allied Democratic Forces have returned to Lubero, rescuing 29 hostages. 1,158 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/world/europe/europe-migrants-rwanda.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihwFBVV95cUxOY3hDQ29FQUxyUUVZV2RBUUFUX0RoUDhEUE40Y3p1VTZ0RTdNakF1QU9OOXkxaWQ1VUdRM09ETVdvaUgxeE1qTXJqSDkzUElaNW1NTmZDUFZ1TGw0bmhud3hDbjBpdjVLRVFLYTdSSHMtZ0tqNDhyRzZMM3FFdUdab21qLWNQek0?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBrckd2V1JMLWpNY2NBd0ZjaV9PRTlvU2JvM3ZrNUZqTDB1cXhKM2EwZWVKN2E2eElEdGRtSWxFTk9fZzRYVE1zSW5JdjdPVWdaTURWMjVXQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxOUjdvMzhsUExDa2lhS3Z4VmpOVlhEWldzTUN2SFhBZFpfVXEtZ0RnNW9mRGFfTnVMTnhKUEdGMGpSR1MyS3lGTTBINE92Zkl0S1AtSHdFaUFIQVZNTXczZW05LWtaUm5CUkZCRTFLbTF2WGZhbDRNYy1uOERxekdIOC1RSDBodVBDdlRIdnlubHN3d0pzMC1WbmU4MHV1aXF3Nm8tX1NCMUUtaUluNnRQUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQTEc3VWRicmFISXlSQWxkVWhYYWM1ZTBfNk9HMVpN